(text "D1 lets a W65C22S (totem-pole IRQB) share ~{IRQ} with\nthe open-drain ACIA; also works with a W65C22N.\nUse a Schottky (< 0.5 V drop).  Pull-up R3 is on the CPU sheet." (at 106.68 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid abf58e82-aee2-5df2-a9e3-78fbda51ac4c))
