(text "J4: FTDI-style 6-pin TTL serial header\n  1 GND  2 CTS# (from ACIA ~{RTS})  3 VCC (n/c)\n  4 TXD (to ACIA RxD)  5 RXD (from ACIA TxD)  6 RTS# (n/c)\nbios.s: 115200 8-N-1, flow control by toggling ACIA ~{RTS}.\n~{CTS}, ~{DSR}, ~{DCD} tied low so the ACIA always transmits." (at 342.9 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 306d1748-d6ac-5de8-9d64-3ab613bdd892))
